  id: 13
  displayName: Single Cause
  type: TwistedEvidence
  text: 'All your health problems stem from one single thing: seed oils. Cut them
    out, and you can reverse almost any disease.'
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is the Single-Cause Fallacy. Complex problems like disease
    are almost never caused by one single thing. This extreme oversimplification
    is a classic red flag."
  hintText: Blames one thing for a problem that actually has many causes.
